// Novus Ordo: the capstone of the Great Seal, from the back of the dollar bill, for projecting over a
// real pyramid (so no pyramid body: the real one is underneath). The eye in its triangle, the glory of
// rays and light around it, "ANNUIT COEPTIS" arched over the top and "NOVUS ORDO SECLORUM" on the
// scroll below, engraved in the bill's greens: dark ink on pale paper with guilloche lines, or (Paper
// off) glowing green on black. The rays and glow pulse with the kick, swell into the drop and burst on
// it; the eye looks round, blinks on the last beat of some bars and opens wide on the drop; a light runs
// along the lettering every bar.
// Params are p_* uniforms; ranges and defaults are in illuminati.json.
// @messages: ANNUIT    COEPTIS|NOVUS ORDO SECLORUM|MDCCLXXVI
